## Layout

- `src/prd/projects.ts` — Project + Epic CRUD
- `src/prd/features.ts` — Feature + AI-assisted scenario generation +
  approval-gate wiring
- `db/migrations/001_prd_init.sql` — `prd.{project, epic, feature,
  scenario, task}` tables

## Hierarchy

```
Project → Epic → Feature → Scenario → Task
                   ↑           ↑         ↑
                   |           |         └─ assignee_persona_id, status
                   |           └─ Given/When/Then JSON
                   └─ acceptance_criteria, approval workflow
```

## Heritage

Projexlight (the product) runs its own production on top of this
blueprint plus a private AI-review SDK. The private SDK is NOT shipped
in this blueprint per the Q-9 decision in the P9 PRD — customers who
install this get the spec storage + AI gateway substrate but author
their own review logic on top.

